统一监管平台中 填报的信息，防止因相关信息未及时公示而被银行业金融机 构退函的风险。", "score": 0.93, "rerank_score": 0.83, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "expanded_context", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence"}}]}
