公司、货币经纪公司、汽车金融公司、消费金融公司。”。", "score": 0.920625, "rerank_score": 0.920625, "chunk_type": "table", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "finance_company_definition", "sheet_name": "机构范围解释", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "企业集团财务公司定义非银行金融机构", "exact_support_score": 0.8125}}]}
